# The DLLs are BUILD OUTPUT (staged here by the engine build, and by CI when it packs the UPM
# tarball) — never committed. Their .meta files ARE committed: a package installed from a registry
# is immutable, so the plugin's import settings (Windows x64, Editor on) cannot be fixed in the
# Inspector afterwards — they have to ship. See tools/upm/gen-meta.ps1.
*.dll
*.pdb
!.gitkeep
!*.dll.meta
